---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy">
  <section class="content legal">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: November 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Controller</h2>
    <p>The controller responsible for processing personal data on this website is:</p>
    <p>
      Anja Boin<br />
      Email: contact@anjaboin.com
    </p>

    <h2>2. General</h2>
    <p>
      This website does not use cookies, analytics or tracking services, and does not embed
      content from external providers. Fonts are loaded directly from this server. Personal
      data is only processed when you visit this website (see section 3) or write to me using
      the contact form (see section 4).
    </p>

    <h2>3. Hosting and server log files</h2>
    <p>
      This website is hosted by STRATO GmbH. When you visit the website, the IP addresses of
      visitors are recorded and stored in log files. The page requested and the browser used
      are also logged.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Purpose:</strong> the technical provision and security of this website, in
      particular detecting and preventing attacks.<br />
      <strong>Legal basis:</strong> Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. My legitimate interest is to provide
      this website securely and reliably.<br />
      <strong>Retention period:</strong> STRATO GmbH stores IP addresses for a maximum of seven days.
      STRATO GmbH only provides me with log files containing anonymised IP addresses.
    </p>
    <p>A data processing agreement in accordance with Art. 28 GDPR has been concluded with STRATO.</p>

    <h2>4. Contact form</h2>
    <p>
      If you write to me using the contact form, I process your name, your email address and
      your message.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Purpose:</strong> handling and answering your request.<br />
      <strong>Legal basis:</strong> Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR if your request relates to a contract or
      to steps prior to entering into a contract; in all other cases Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. My
      legitimate interest is to answer your request.<br />
      <strong>Recipients:</strong> your message is sent via STRATO's mail server to my mailbox
      at [mailbox provider].<br />
      <strong>Retention period:</strong> I delete your details as soon as your request has been
      fully dealt with, unless statutory retention obligations prevent this.
    </p>
    <p>
      Providing the details in the contact form is neither a statutory nor a contractual
      requirement. However, without your name, email address and message I cannot answer your
      request.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Transfers outside the EU</h2>
    <p>Your data is not transferred to countries outside the European Union.</p>

    <h2>6. Automated decision-making</h2>
    <p>No automated decision-making, including profiling, takes place.</p>

    <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You have the right to access the data stored about you, and the rights to rectification,
      erasure and restriction of processing, to object to processing and to data portability.
      To exercise these rights, simply contact me at the email address above.
    </p>
    <p>
      You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory
      authority. The authority responsible for me is the Dutch Data Protection Authority
      (Autoriteit Persoonsgegevens).
    </p>

    <h2>8. Links to other websites</h2>
    <p>
      This website contains links to other websites. The privacy policy of the other website
      only applies once you click on such a link.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }
</style>